// src/lib/creatorStudio.js
// ── Creator Studio — cinematic teaser project data ──────────────
// Reverse-engineered in-house equivalent of the Opus.pro "Creator
// Studio" concept (anchors / locations / vehicles & gear) built on
// the ElevenLabs creative pipeline (Nano Banana Pro, Veo, Sora,
// Runway, composition). Assets are generated by Claude via the
// creative_* MCP tools and registered here; this module is the
// review/status layer the CRM renders — it does not call generation
// APIs itself (no provider key is exposed to the client bundle).

